WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.531 --> 00:00:15.552
Roxy watched as Cozlin and Sapphire fought two aliens.

2
00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:17.773
One alien had bat wings.

3
00:00:18.233 --> 00:00:19.693
The other one looked like a cloud.

4
00:00:20.173 --> 00:00:21.914
The cloud swirled around Cozlin.

5
00:00:26.095 --> 00:00:26.895
Cozlin cried.

6
00:00:26.915 --> 00:00:28.976
"I'm getting dizzy!"

7
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.984
She moved fast, darting across the stadium while the cloud still swirled.

8
00:00:34.685 --> 00:00:37.448
Sapphire swooped down, blasting the cloud with flames.

9
00:00:38.649 --> 00:00:40.632
When the smoke cleared, the cloud was gone.

10
00:00:41.573 --> 00:00:42.353
The bat gulped.

11
00:00:43.094 --> 00:00:44.616
"I surrender!"

12
00:00:44.636 --> 00:00:48.880
"The winners are Kid Comet and the dragon!"

13
00:00:49.341 --> 00:00:50.322
the Battle Master said.

14
00:00:51.083 --> 00:00:51.884
The crowd cheered.

15
00:00:57.788 --> 00:01:00.069
A chipmunk sniffed the bronze door in the mountains.

16
00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:03.631
Suddenly light sparkled, and a portal opened.

17
00:01:04.052 --> 00:01:05.332
The chipmunk hurried away.

18
00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:08.774
Terrell, Bajie, and the bird stepped out of the portal.

19
00:01:12.036 --> 00:01:12.897
Bippo followed them.

20
00:01:12.917 --> 00:01:14.277
"Here's the door."

21
00:01:16.138 --> 00:01:17.719
Terrell pushed, but it didn't open.

22
00:01:17.739 --> 00:01:19.941
"Stand back, Terrell!"

23
00:01:20.621 --> 00:01:21.862
Bajie swung his rake.

24
00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:25.864
Clang! The rake rattled, shaking Bajie until he dropped it.

25
00:01:26.176 --> 00:01:27.737
The door was still closed.

26
00:01:27.757 --> 00:01:29.998
"Bippo," Terrell said.

27
00:01:30.018 --> 00:01:32.720
"Can you open a portal to get us inside?"

28
00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:34.901
"There's no need."

29
00:01:35.461 --> 00:01:38.103
The bird muttered a spell, and the door swung open.

30
00:01:41.004 --> 00:01:43.486
Bajie grabbed his rake, and everyone went inside.

31
00:01:44.687 --> 00:01:47.848
A long corridor led them to a large, empty chamber.

32
00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:52.411
Terrell looked at the old vase.

33
00:01:52.431 --> 00:01:53.952
"I don't understand.

34
00:01:54.572 --> 00:01:57.755
I thought Guanyin was going to help—" Rumble!

35
00:01:58.155 --> 00:02:02.299
Rumble! The chamber shook, sending pieces of rock crashing down.

36
00:02:02.739 --> 00:02:03.700
Bajie fell over.

37
00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.901
"Oof!" Terrell gulped.

38
00:02:06.722 --> 00:02:08.063
"It's another earthquake!"

39
00:02:08.824 --> 00:02:11.586
The bird tipped the vase, and gold coins poured out.

40
00:02:12.807 --> 00:02:14.368
Right away the earthquake grew weaker.

41
00:02:15.009 --> 00:02:16.910
The bird flew around, pouring coins.

42
00:02:17.411 --> 00:02:19.693
They formed large piles all over the chamber.

43
00:02:20.413 --> 00:02:23.656
As the last coin rolled out, the shaking stopped completely.

44
00:02:24.128 --> 00:02:26.390
"Whoa!" Terrell stared at the vase.

45
00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:30.833
"I can't believe Light sparkled, and the bird disappeared.

46
00:02:31.373 --> 00:02:32.734
A woman stood in its place.

47
00:02:34.275 --> 00:02:35.396
Bajie bowed and chuckled.

48
00:02:35.416 --> 00:02:39.359
"I knew that was you, Bodhisattva!"

49
00:02:39.940 --> 00:02:40.860
Terrell gasped.

50
00:02:41.501 --> 00:02:43.902
"You're the bodhisattva Guanyin!"

51
00:02:44.603 --> 00:02:45.664
Guanyin smiled.

52
00:02:45.684 --> 00:02:48.866
"Yes, and this is the gold that was stolen.

53
00:02:49.286 --> 00:02:54.221
Balance has been restored, and there will be no more earthquakes."

54
00:02:55.161 --> 00:02:59.182
The group went back outside, and the massive door closed gently behind them.

55
00:02:59.202 --> 00:03:01.543
"Thank you," Terrell said.

56
00:03:01.563 --> 00:03:04.023
"You're welcome," Guanyin said.

57
00:03:04.043 --> 00:03:06.784
"Yeah, no problem at all!"

58
00:03:07.224 --> 00:03:08.005
Bajie grinned.

59
00:03:08.665 --> 00:03:10.605
Then he and the bodhisattva vanished.

60
00:03:11.425 --> 00:03:12.806
Terrell was about to call Dr.

61
00:03:12.926 --> 00:03:14.886
Odd when he heard heavy footsteps approaching.

62
00:03:15.447 --> 00:03:16.947
He spun around and saw Dr.

63
00:03:17.047 --> 00:03:18.407
Odd's robot running toward him.

64
00:03:18.427 --> 00:03:21.432
"I was just about to call you," Terrell said.

65
00:03:21.452 --> 00:03:23.213
"We stopped the earthquakes!"

66
00:03:24.094 --> 00:03:25.875
"Excellent work, Terrell," Dr.

67
00:03:25.975 --> 00:03:26.475
Odd said.

68
00:03:26.495 --> 00:03:27.776
"Now come with me.

69
00:03:28.496 --> 00:03:30.017
It's time to save our friends!"

70
00:03:30.037 --> 00:03:33.239
"Where are we going?"

71
00:03:33.699 --> 00:03:34.479
Terrell asked.

72
00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.521
They were in a small spaceship, orbiting Earth.

73
00:03:38.481 --> 00:03:39.522
Dr. Odd smiled.

74
00:03:39.542 --> 00:03:41.083
"Far away.

75
00:03:41.663 --> 00:03:42.724
We'll need my moon."

76
00:03:43.844 --> 00:03:46.566
Soon the spaceship was docked in one of the moon's hangars.

77
00:03:47.686 --> 00:03:49.307
They went to the control room, where Dr.

78
00:03:49.407 --> 00:03:50.488
Odd pressed some buttons.

79
00:03:55.936 --> 00:03:57.197
The moon shook for a moment.

80
00:03:57.217 --> 00:03:58.698
"What just happened?"

81
00:03:59.059 --> 00:03:59.779
Terrell asked.

82
00:04:04.423 --> 00:04:05.544
went through a portal."

83
00:04:05.864 --> 00:04:07.526
Dr. Odd pressed some more buttons.

84
00:04:07.546 --> 00:04:11.028
"We are now millions of light-years from Earth."

85
00:04:12.289 --> 00:04:15.392
The moon rotated, and Terrell saw a strange space station.

86
00:04:16.453 --> 00:04:17.614
Platforms surrounded it.

87
00:04:18.014 --> 00:04:19.495
They were filled with spaceships.

88
00:04:20.536 --> 00:04:21.777
Terrell scratched his head.

89
00:04:21.797 --> 00:04:24.459
"That looks like a stadium."

90
00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.942
Dr. Odd nodded, looking grim.

91
00:04:27.962 --> 00:04:30.365
"That's where our friends are.

92
00:04:31.105 --> 00:04:33.347
It's called the Stadium of the Stars."
